flowchart LR
    A[Pending moderation] --> B[Moderator claims]
    B --> C{Review}
    C -->|Approve| D[Active + history + notifications]
    C -->|Request changes| E[Changes requested + seller guidance]
    E --> F[Seller edits/resubmits]
    F --> A
    C -->|Reject| G[Rejected + policy/refund follow-up]
    C -->|Escalate| H[Senior review case]
    D -->|Post-publication issue| I[Suspended]
    I -->|Resolved| D
    I -->|Closed| J[Archived]
